      "local_notes": "**Type:** Regular; Resisted by HT  \n**Cost:** 2  \n**Maintenance:** 1  \n**Casting Time:** 2 seconds  \n**Duration:** 10 minutes\n\nOn a failed HT resistance roll, the subject immediately gains **4 Stimulation**. This is magical physical arousal and reduces Inhibition normally. It does not compel sexual behaviour or prevent the subject from resisting advances.\n\nWhile the spell remains active, sexual techniques used on the subject receive **+1 Stimulation**.\n\nCollege and spell prerequisites were not specified in the supplied notes and remain unset; use the campaign decision when assigning them."
